---
title: Browser SDK · activating one document before the preview boots
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant boot as Inert bootstrap
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant rt as Document runtime
  participant ing as Browser ingestion

  Note over boot,cp: Same-origin, through the reserved uTrace<br/>endpoint at the preview front door.
  boot->>cp: activate · existing authenticated session context + new document nonce
  cp-->>boot: signed document attestation + page proof
  Note over boot: Verifies with the packaged<br/>uTrace public key.
  boot->>cp: exchange the attestation once
  cp-->>boot: short-lived, write-only telemetry credential
  boot->>rt: start · pinned policy and manifest versions
  rt->>ing: open the export WebSocket · credential
  rt->>ing: initial baseline
  ing-->>rt: acknowledgement
  alt every readiness check passes
    Note over rt: ready · the preview hydrates
  else activation or readiness fails
    Note over boot,rt: The preview reports the failure<br/>and never boots unobserved.
  end
